</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{KV}\leftarrow\mathbf{KV}^{&lt;b}\oplus\mathbf{KV}^{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊𝐕</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊𝐕</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">b</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊕</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">b</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{KV}\leftarrow\mathbf{KV}^{&lt;b}\oplus\mathbf{KV}^{b}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Accumulate KV cache
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="alg1.l12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">return</span><span id="alg1.l13.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}^{1:B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">B</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}^{1:B}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l13.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Encoder-Decoder Block Diffusion Sampling with KV Caching</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.SS3.fig3" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
